 "remarks": "Spectacular setting! A true nature lover's paradise-where privacy and natural beauty meet.At the end of a private lane,this home offers a serene escape in the heart of back-country Greenwich. The 2 acre property is bordered on 3 sides by the beautiful Audubon property. Enjoy breathtaking woodland views from almost every room. Relax on the deck and listen to birds.  Forget the ''to-do'' list--it's already done. This home is packed with value-added features: Major Mechanics: New Furnace, AC Unit, Condenser, and Ductwork. Structural Updates: New Roofs (Main & Addition), Gutters, and Chimney Flashing. Water & Power: New Well, Backup Generator, and full Filtration System. New Window Moldings, Stone Walkways, and Rebuilt Rock Walls. Make it your own, relax & enjoy!",
